{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>FinderHub 是一款為日常生活而設的周邊地點助手，開啟應用後會自動顯示附近的超級市場，亦可直接搜尋藥房、託兒所、餐廳或自動櫃員機等類別，適合經常外出購物、取藥或臨時找餐廳的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>附近地點即時顯示與一鍵導航</h2>\n<p>FinderHub 啟動後即自動標示附近的超級市場，不必面對空白地圖。使用者可輸入藥房、託兒所、餐廳或街道名稱搜尋，結果以清晰圖釘顯示於地圖上，點選即可查看名稱與地址，並一鍵在 Apple Maps 或 Google Maps 開啟路線。應用不設帳戶、不追蹤使用者，資料只儲存於裝置之中。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-20-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-21-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-22-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-23-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-24-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-25-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FinderHub – Places Near Me</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T22:38:56.341760+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}